  "id": "list_5m_contours",
  "title": "LIST 5 m Contours",
  "description": "LIST 5 m Contours: LIST product `LIST_5M_CONTOURS`, statewide. 70,668 features, multi-linestring (EPSG:28355). Built from the 29 per-LGA LIST zips: features LIST clipped at LGA boundaries are rejoined to one row per `LIST_GUID`, and an `lga` column names the source LGA(s); parts outside every LGA (over open water) are not in any LGA file. Source released 2025-07-17. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU: cite as \"LIST 5 m Contours\" from theLIST (c) State of Tasmania.",
